translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_81a1434c:

    # e "Hello, Rahim. May I ask if you've seen any prose in Lusterfield?"
    e "你好,雷希姆, 请问你有没有在乐斯民菲尔德看过什么流言?"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_1b771e77:

    # "Rahim raises an eyebrow towards you."
    "雷希姆向你眉毛高高。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_470a1a5d:

    # r "Prose?"
    r "Prose？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_0627904e:

    # e "Yeah. I suppose it's a ballad."
    e "是的。我想是一场大歌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_90883622:

    # r "What's it about?"
    r "这是关于什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_4c4b19ce:

    # e "It's about an old hero... who killed a monster or some sort. I've not read the whole thing yet."
    e "是关于一个老英雄……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_044b83e9:

    # r "Old hero."
    r "老英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_974a37ee:

    # r "Monster."
    r "怪物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_c55d96ba:

    # "Rahim taps on his needle."
    "雷希姆用针头敲打他的针头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_c34f50c3:

    # "He stares on the floor for a while."
    "他盯着地板看一阵子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_df3dc88c:

    # r "I don't have the prose."
    r "我没有讲稿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_808e2878:

    # e "Uhm... do you know about any other people with a prose?"
    e "你知道有其他有传言的人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_812afdf7:

    # r "Ole had one before, rolled. He showed it to me a while ago."
    r "奥利以前有一张 滚过 不久前他给我看了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_245680af:

    # "Rahim goes back to work once more, you're not sure if he has ended the conversation alltogether."
    "雷希姆又回去工作了 你不确定他是否已经结束了谈话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_3b59ed57:

    # e "Thanks, Rahim."
    e "谢谢,雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_23f57c1f:

    # "The bull gives you another glance, and nods as you leave."
    "公牛再给你一眼 点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_50030f6e:

    # e "Hey, Amble, have you seen a prose? Or anyone that's interested in poems and ballads?"
    e "嘿,安布,你有没有看过一个传言?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_d1dfa7a3:

    # a "Oh, hey there, puny friend."
    a "哦，嘿，小朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_390031a4:

    # "Amble scatches his chin."
    "安布的下巴紧紧抓住了他的下巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_e9eba489:

    # a "I- I don't think so. I've only been chopping wood around the village, and Jog's not the one to read."
    a "我不这么认为 我只是在村子里砍木头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_593fdd58:

    # j "Maybe that lizard."
    j "也许那只蜥蜴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_0c9349ab:

    # "Jog exclaims from afar."
    "乔格在远处的赞誉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_2e890f1c:

    # j "Ole seems like the guy to read books, I've lived with him long enough."
    j "奥利好像是看书的人 我和他一起住够久了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_888eb8a6:

    # e "Oh?"
    e "哦？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_d5071b57:

    # a "Aha, I've heard him talk about collecting some paper as well, maybe he's your guy?"
    a "啊哈，我听说过他 谈到收集一些纸 也，也许他是你的人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_22c163e9:

    # a "But Rahim, on the other hands tells stories that are good for bedtime, I think he reads a lot too."
    a "但雷希姆在另一只手里讲述的故事对睡觉有好处, 我想他也读了很多书。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_d3ef8f4b:

    # j "That's not poems, ya oaf."
    j "这不是诗，你这笨蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_fa250801:

    # a "Oh!"
    a "哦！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_c90f4935:

    # "Amble brushes the back of his head."
    "安布刷刷了他的后脑勺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_a388557b:

    # e "Well, thank you you two for the help, I'll go ask the others."
    e "谢谢你们两个帮忙 我去问问其他人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_2d2e7bc5:

    # a "Good luck to you!"
    a "祝你好运！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_bf210b69:

    # e "Ole, have you seen a prose?"
    e "奥利，你看过一篇讲稿吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_8a2080e6:

    # o "Uhm... prose?"
    o "嗯…… 讲稿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_4c8cad40:

    # e "Yeah. There's an ancient marking on a red ribbon that bounds the parchment."
    e "是的，红丝带上有一个古老的标记 上面有纸条的界限。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_af8f9d48:

    # "Ole looks uncomfortable, he puts down the brush and slightly nudges on his dewlaps."
    "奥利看起来不舒服 他把刷子放下 露珠上也稍微擦了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_2eca18f9:

    # o "Can we go to your room?"
    o "我们可以去你的房间吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_1b99c36a:

    # "Your cheeks instantly blush."
    "你的脸脸立刻脸红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_662e4448:

    # e "It's in the middle of the day! I'm not ready-"
    e "已经是大白天了，我还没准备好"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_e20a49d8:

    # o "It's something important."
    o "这是很重要的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_b7c4d90f:

    # "The lizard leads you to your own room, he closes the door delicately before turning to you."
    "蜥蜴带你到你自己的房间 他小心地关上门然后转向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_c30e3dad:

    # o "Uhm... well. Let's talk."
    o "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_cffee1ac:

    # e "Ole, why are we in this room?"
    e "奥莱，我们为什么在这个房间里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_fdbcf1ee:

    # o "Seb's not going to like what we're going to talk about."
    o "Seb不会喜欢我们谈的话题的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_780bfde3:

    # o "But first, why are you looking for the prose?"
    o "但首先，你为什么在找这篇传言？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_789d1d8c:

    # e "There's a bard, Pirkka. Who recently got stolen the prose from a bandit."
    e "有个酒吧，皮尔卡，他最近从强盗那里 偷来的传言。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_9ebbdb50:

    # "He sits on your bed, trying to close the windows shut."
    "他坐在你床上 试图关上窗户。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_22c70ff4:

    # o "I can't hide anything from you, can I?"
    o "我不能对你隐瞒任何事，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_4c2529df:

    # o "His prose is upstairs."
    o "他的流言在楼上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_a55f89be:

    # "You gasp in surprise, but Ole puts a finger in front of your mouth."
    "你吃了一惊,但奥利在你的嘴前插了一根手指。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_808bfd21:

    # o "[e], I don't take pride with dealing with bandits, but they've just found a work I've been collecting."
    o "[e] 我不为对付土匪感到骄傲 但他们刚找到我收集的作品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_8ba369c5:

    # e "Collecting?"
    e "收集吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_b6528b4c:

    # o "I collected a lot of books, prose, all manuscripts, they're all right upstairs."
    o "我收集了很多书， 讲稿， 所有手稿， 他们都在楼上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_8c9ff642:

    # "Ole sits close to you, you can almost smell his breath as he nervously speaks."
    "奥利坐在你身边 你几乎能闻到他紧张说话时的气息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_36b18919:

    # o "It's been a while since I last bought... collected anything."
    o "我上次买东西 收集东西已经有一段时间了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_9a48debd:

    # o "It's really been a while, until I saw it in the alleyway. They'd been trying to get me to buy stuff for years."
    o "好久不见，直到我在巷子里看到，他们多年来一直想让我买东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_eab158ad:

    # o "I didn't know what I was thinking, I bought the prose with 3000 gold. You must not tell Seb about this."
    o "我不知道我在想些什么，我用3000金买的传言 你不能告诉塞巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_3984d8a1:

    # e "T-that... that's a lot of gold, Ole."
    e "这... 有很多金子,奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_9de69a41:

    # o "Not just about the gold, but I promised myself I'm not collecting anything like them ever again."
    o "不只是金子的事 我答应自己不再收集金子了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_75baa351:

    # o "I don't know what's going on, but ever since you came, I've not been the one who I was proud of being."
    o "我不知道发生了什么，但自从你来， 我一直不 谁是我骄傲的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_d4d9c1ee:

    # "Ole exclaims, he seems much more fidgety than usual."
    "他似乎比平时更脆弱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_9d2f2d12:

    # e "Alright."
    e "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_0995d6b5:

    # o "The prose should go back to its owner."
    o "传言应该回到主人那里去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_b052b2b3:

    # o "W-where's Pirkka?"
    o "皮尔卡在哪里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_8df2b267:

    # e "He's in the Tavern."
    e "他在酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_757c30f8:

    # o "Let's go then. I should apologise to him personally."
    o "走吧，我应该亲自向他道歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_a21b29ee:

    # "The lizard pats your back, before you both get up from the room."
    "蜥蜴在你们从房间出来之前 拍拍你的背。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_fa7ab824:

    # "You look up as Ole tells the lion to take care of the shop for a moment."
    "你看着奥利 告诉狮子 照顾 店的一瞬间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_77a21238:

    # "Sebas stares at both of you with a puzzled look as Ole goes upstairs to retrieve the poem."
    "奥利上楼取回诗时 塞巴斯一副迷惑不解的眼神盯着你们两个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_06891b07:

    # s "Hey, buddy. What's going on with my big O?"
    s "嘿，哥们，我的大O怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_cb8f196f:

    # s "Don't tell me he's done stuff in your room."
    s "别告诉我他在你房间做过事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_81d6c63b:

    # e "Seb, it's nothing like that."
    e "Seb，不是那样的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_cac464be:

    # s "Ha, you're just making me much more curious now."
    s "哈，你只是让我现在更好奇了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_6a8ea4da:

    # "Sebas pauses as Ole arrives with a side glance."
    "当奥利一眼就看到塞巴斯的停顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_16eb5094:

    # s "Uhm, I see nothing."
    s "嗯，我什么也看不见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_695f2079:

    # "The lizard gestures you to follow him."
    "蜥蜴的手势让你跟着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_ab9f864f:

    # "And soon, you two arrive to the Nocturnal Trunk."
    "很快，你们两个就到了夜幕之夜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_37dd854d:

    # "Inside the dimly lit tavern, you and Ole spots Pirkka sitting at a table in the corner, tapping on his lute on a certain beat."
    "在光线暗淡的酒馆里 你和奥利发现皮尔卡坐在角落的桌子上 拍着他的滑轮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_0004e8b2:

    # p "There you are, come here, my friend."
    p "你在这里，过来，我的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_7f3563fc:

    # "Pirkka points at you."
    "皮尔卡 指向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_576caf6a:

    # p "And who's this fella over here?"
    p "谁是这个家伙？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_235472c9:

    # e "He's Ole, we lived together in a shop nearby actually."
    e "他是奥利,我们住在附近的一家商店里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_ab259291:

    # "The bard notices the familiar parchment from Ole's hand."
    "条子注意到奥利手上熟悉的羊皮纸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_d4892461:

    # p "Greetings, dear Ole. I see you have something that belongs to me."
    p "你好,亲爱的奥利,我看你有我的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_faf5e617:

    # o "I apologise, Pirkka. I didn't know it was yours. I can return the prose to you unscathed, with a bit of price."
    o "对不起，皮尔卡，我不知道那是你的，我可以给你些小费。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_59bc82e8:

    # p "I'm willing to pay 1000 gold for its safe return."
    p "我愿意付一千金 保证它的安全归来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_5c473a13:

    # o "But, I can't let it go for any less than 2500 gold. It's a rare piece of literature, you know."
    o "但是，我不能让它只卖不到2500个黄金，这是很稀有的文学作品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_76f8c21c:

    # o "And I bought it for 3000 gold, that 500 gold should cover for all your troubles."
    o "我买了三千块金子 五百块金子应该能弥补你所有的麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_f3682b95:

    # e "H-hey Ole, didn't we talk about this?"
    e "H -Hey 奥利，我们不是谈过这个吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_3cc78cd4:

    # "You whisper as you grab Ole's arm tightly."
    "紧紧抓住奥利的手臂时低声低语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_0c87d2c7:

    # o "I didn't tell you I'm letting it go for free."
    o "我没告诉你我免费放它走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_307770b0:

    # p "Fair, but [e] here went the trouble to retrieve the prose from the depth of bandit's den. 500 gold can't cover all that."
    p "公平，但[e]在这里费了很大劲 才从强盗窝深处取回传言 500金不能覆盖所有那些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_ae69c359:

    # p "1500 gold."
    p "游戏对话框是 1500金。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_4a8ee3e5:

    # o "2300, that should be the final price."
    o "2300，这应该是最后的价格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_c5ce6257:

    # p "How about 1700?"
    p "1700怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_e5bd78c5:

    # e "H-hey, Ole. Shouldn't you lower the price a little? You said you didn't want to collect them in the first place."
    e "奥利,你不应该降低一点价格吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_16cbbb93:

    # o "That doesn't mean I'm not going for a better price."
    o "这并不意味着我不会去 一个更好的价格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_dff08d2e:

    # o "And I trust Pirkka here has the gold for it."
    o "我相信皮尔卡有金子买。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_60cfa99b:

    # "Pirkka smiles at Ole's statement."
    "皮尔卡对奥利的口供微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_1d73e435:

    # e "Ole, the prose was stolen."
    e "奥利， 传言被偷了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_fd76f75a:

    # "It's only now that Ole's stare turns into some realization."
    "现在奥利的目光才逐渐变成某种意识。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_07abc845:

    # o "..."
    o "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_861902ed:

    # o "Sorry, old habit."
    o "抱歉，老习惯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_be468dca:

    # e "I thought Seb was the one that deal with the customers and all."
    e "我以为塞布是那个 和顾客和所有交易的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_0cffb4f9:

    # o "Who do you think taught him all that."
    o "你认为是谁教他这些的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_523d5c50:

    # "The lizard chuckles."
    "蜥蜴笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_7c1ed92c:

    # o "Yeah, I'm so sorry for pushing it, Pirkka. I'll take 1500 gold."
    o "是的，我很抱歉推了它，皮尔卡，我要1500块金子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_46ffb0b1:

    # p "Oh? You are so interesting, Ole. But thank you so much."
    p "你真有趣,奥利,但谢谢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_5d18db9e:

    # "You remain silent, waiting for the two men to settle the deal."
    "你保持沉默，等待双方达成协议。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_b696d767:

    # p "Very well. 2250 gold it is."
    p "很好。它是2250金。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_8f138eaa:

    # p "I've never paid for something this expensive, especially those that should've been mine."
    p "我从来没有付过这么贵的钱 尤其是应该是我的钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_a7e6221a:

    # o "Sorry, but I bought it fair and square from a bandit."
    o "对不起，但我从一个土匪那里买的 公平而正宗的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_46ab3aa5:

    # p "No need to apologize, you're not the one who stole the prose from me, if anything I should thank you for willing to give it back."
    p "没必要道歉，你不是那个偷我写诗的人 如果有什么我应该感谢你愿意还给我的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_48d526c5:

    # "Pirkka gives Ole a pouch full of gold, and he's returned his prose."
    "皮尔卡给了奥利一袋金子 他又回信了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_d0afa833:

    # "Both of them stares at the item they have received, before they shake their hand."
    "他们俩在握手之前，都盯着收到的物品看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_a2bbc3f6:

    # p "It's been a pleasure seeing you two, but I should store this precious artifact in a better place first."
    p "很高兴见到你们 但我应该先把这件珍贵的文物 存放在更好的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_11aa9fd6:

    # p "I'll be returning to the tavern soon enough, play the full ballad in front of you."
    p "我很快会回到酒馆 在你面前演奏全场的歌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_dd82f3ad:

    # p "May we meet again."
    p "愿我们再次相聚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_b4c6f9d5:

    # "The bard flings his lute, and he leaves you and Ole with another simple tune."
    "酒巴挥舞着他的润滑剂, 他留给你和奥利 另一首简单的曲子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_b21354ce:

    # "Ole nods, he pauses for a few moment before standing up."
    "奥莱点头，他暂停了一会儿才站起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_8c9962d6:

    # o "Kiddo, ready to go?"
    o "游戏对话是 Kiddo 准备好走了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_92f16cc0:

    # e "Yeah."
    e "是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_0aafadbf:

    # "You stare at Ole, who only looks at you with a regretful glance."
    "你盯着奥利看,他只以遗憾的目光看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_64b26e3f:

    # "Perhaps you now know him more than what he lets you see, you can only hope it's a good thing."
    "也许你现在了解他比他让你看到的更多 你只能希望这是件好事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_c372fb80:

    # e "Ole?"
    e "奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_47b3a55c:

    # o "I'm sorry, [e], but I don't want to talk about this yet."
    o "抱歉 [e] 但我还不想谈这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_f468a67c:

    # e "Alright, I understand."
    e "好吧，我理解。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_f5ddc967:

    # o "It's all me, please don't blame yourself for what happened."
    o "都怪我，请不要怪自己 发生了什么事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_cdcc843a:

    # e "I- I didn't."
    e "我没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_3f96132b:

    # "Ole nods, he smiles at you before leaving the tavern as well."
    "奥莱点头，他在离开酒馆前对你微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d8da8960:

    # "You hear wheat ruffling from afar, it sounds like it was from the plum tree..."
    "你听到远处的小麦翻滚的声音 听起来像是梅子树上的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2b276959:

    # e "The thief must be here... right now."
    e "小偷一定在这里…… 现在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2f386a40:

    # "There's no doubt someone's here."
    "毫无疑问有人在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ad5a8517:

    # "Immediately, You race through the grasses back to the plum trees. All the ripe plums you saw just a moment ago are gone. The thief has already taken them all."
    "刚刚你看到的所有成熟的李子都不见了 小偷已经把他们都带走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_16b77fa2:

    # e "F-fuck, I have to catch him..."
    e "F操，我得抓住他……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_7a23f3a4:

    # "You can still hear the muffled sound coming from your left, but you see another trail on the right, freshly stomped by someone."
    "你仍能听见左侧传来的闷响，但右边另有一条小径，显然刚被什么人踩过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_4d379e98:

    # "You follow the shuffling noise, raising your ears to detect the source of the sound."
    "你跟着打乱的声音 举起耳朵 探出声音的来源。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ca7d6487:

    # "The sound doesn't fade away, instead it's kept constant as you approach."
    "声音不会消失 反而会保持恒定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d7e3edf9:

    # "You try to stay as quiet as possible, for the thief to not notice you."
    "你尽量保持安静 让小偷没注意到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_def47a4b:

    # "Jog had taught you about stealth in one of your training, but you're not sure if you are ever experienced enough to tail a thief who's probably more skilful than you are."
    "乔格在一次训练中教你偷盗 但你不确定你是否经验丰富 是否跟踪一个可能比你更熟练的小偷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_b0eacb23:

    # "But still, it had helped you figure out how to muffle your own noise."
    "但是，它还是帮助你 找出如何打动自己的噪音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_afcb5cbf:

    # "You crouch, sneaking just below the small grass while the sound somewhere near you continues walking away from the farm."
    "你蹲下，偷偷溜到小草地下边……。..而你附近的声音……。..继续从农场走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_eb8969ba:

    # "Suddenly, you hear a loud cracking sound just below your right foot."
    "突然，你听到响亮的响声 就在你的右脚下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ae90c3b4:

    # "C-CRACK!"
    "C -CRACK！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_feebc0da:

    # "Without further glance, you accidentally step on a flail twig. And for a second, your heart sinks."
    "你无意中踩到了一根小树枝 突然间，你的心就沉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_77e63caa:

    # "The pacing noise stops, perhaps someone has noticed your presence."
    "音速的噪音停止， 也许有人注意到你的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_c264b283:

    # "You are unsure if he has noticed you, but if he does, you'd think you're ready for a fight."
    "你不确定他有没有注意到你 但如果他注意到你 你会认为你准备好打架了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_35b5e4b5:

    # "Something is awry, he might have already seen you and is thinking of the fastest way to escape."
    "他可能已经见过你了 并且想着最快的逃跑方法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_0ccc1edd:

    # "You know which direction he is in, and with certain agility, you might as well be able to catch him."
    "你知道他朝哪个方向走的， 以一定的敏捷性， 你也许能抓住他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_715f03f6:

    # "Perhaps the thief was the one that stepped on the stalks, you choose to follow the trails."
    "也许小偷是踩在尾巴上的人 你选择跟着足迹走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d43ec6ff:

    # "Taking the faint footstep by the flattened plants, you walked for a while that the ruffled sound from the other side stopped."
    "你走过一段路，从另一边听到的摇晃声停止了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_934b159f:

    # "You are still figuring out which direction it leads to, before noticing that as you go forwards, the trail seems to get more and more obscure, until it disappears at one point."
    "你仍然在弄清楚它导致的方向， 在注意到你前进之前， 线索似乎越来越模糊， 直到它消失在某一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_8592c8be:

    # "It leads to a muddy footstep that's facing your direction."
    "它导致一个泥巴的脚步 面对你的方向。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_7af317a5:

    # "It was a dead end."
    "它是一条死胡同。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_085aa496:

    # "You look around one last time, just to make sure the thief is not nearby."
    "你再看看最后一次， 只是为了确保小偷不在附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_56d8e85e:

    # "But eventually, you return to the farm empty handed, knowing that the plums are gone, again."
    "但最终，你空手回到农场 明知梅子已经没了，你又回到了农场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_7662cee2:

    # "You run after the thief, solely based on the direction of the sound."
    "你追着小偷跑， 仅仅根据声音的方向。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2a70c8df:

    # "The rash movement you've made immediately reveals your presence to him. Now standing tall, you can see a gray figure hidden in grass and flowers."
    "站在高高的地上，可以看到藏在草丛和花朵中的灰色人物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_63b28fc2:

    # rbd "S-shit."
    rbd "S -shit。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_c300f281:

    # "You hear a hushed voice just in front of you."
    "你听到一个安静的声音 就在你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_55fb5705:

    # "The thief starts running away, he looks relatively small in size, and it seems he runs swiftly just like Jog does."
    "小偷开始逃跑， 他看起来相对较小大小， 似乎他跑得很快 就像乔格一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_09c227f0:

    # "You speed up, draining all your energy just to catch a glimpse of the thief. but he doesn't slow down as well."
    "你加快速度 耗尽你所有的能量 只为了一眼就能看见小偷 但他并没有减速。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_5aaee271:

    # "You try to run as fast as you can, and you manage to keep a constant distance between you and the thief."
    "尽量跑得快 尽量保持你和贼之间的距离。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_3b31daee:

    # "And eventually, he loses stamina pretty quickly, and you closes distance with him bit by bit."
    "最终，他很快失去耐力， 而你却一一点点地接近他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_e5fa3b4b:

    # "Suddenly, you lose sight of him."
    "突然间，你忽略了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_66be56f1:

    # "Did he just, escaped? There's no way as he was just here seconds ago."
    "他刚刚逃出来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_3fba7c31:

    # "There's no sigh of the thief, anywhere."
    "没有小偷的气息，任何地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a20cefa7_2:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_1b88f674:

    # "SMACK!"
    "SMACK！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2a43808c:

    # "Suddenly, an enraged rat just jumps in front of you."
    "突然，一只愤怒的老鼠 突然跳到你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_4ddfa7fc:

    # "There's no plum on his hands, instead you see daggers pointing towards you."
    "他手上没有梅子，你却看到匕首指着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d15e028b:

    # rbd "Let's get over with it, fool."
    rbd "让我们结束它吧，傻瓜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_0437b980:

    # "You try to run as fast as you can, but... he is faster."
    "你尽量快跑 但是…… 他跑得更快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_8b181bd7:

    # "It doesn't take long before you lose sight of the thief."
    "很快你就会失去对小偷的视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_085aa496_1:

    # "You look around one last time, just to make sure the thief is not nearby."
    "你再看看最后一次， 只是为了确保小偷不在附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_56d8e85e_1:

    # "But eventually, you return to the farm empty handed, knowing that the plums are gone, again."
    "但最终，你空手回到农场 明知梅子已经没了，你又回到了农场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ab2483f5:

    # "You decide to stand still, not moving a single muscle or making a single sound."
    "你决定站着别动，不动任何肌肉 也不发出任何声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_cac58dec:

    # "Somehow, the farm is weirdly quiet for a few seconds. You know the thief is looking around, and you can only hope that he doesn't see you."
    "不知怎的，农场里安静了几秒钟 你知道小偷在四处转转，你只能希望他没看见你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ddc74e25:

    # "The twig underneath your foot is still making faint noise from any minor movement."
    "你脚下的小树枝 仍然在发出微微的噪音 从任何微小的动作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_0c47fdcd:

    # "You can only lay your weight onto the other foot, waiting for the thief to continue on their way."
    "你只能把体重放在另一只脚上 等待贼继续前进。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_39ad214a:

    # "Something moved, you are sure that the thief has started moving around, perhaps he continues on his path, or perhaps he's trying to search for you."
    "东西移动，你肯定 小偷已经开始移动， 也许他继续他的路径， 或者他试图寻找你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_cc3705a0:

    # "You are not coping with the nervousness very well, sweat pours from the side of your head, moistens your fluffy beard."
    "你没有适应 紧张的很好， 汗水从你的头侧 倾注，湿润你的毛胡子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_e7202fe8:

    # "And now that even a drop of sweat has become so noticeable in such a quiet place, there's really nowhere to hide."
    "现在，即使一滴汗 也变得如此明显 在这样一个安静的地方， 真的没有地方躲藏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2ad49062:

    # rbd "Must have been the... scarecrows."
    rbd "一定是稻草人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_0b356b44:

    # "The thief mutters softly to himself, you are sort of surprised how pleasant his voice sounds, even if you haven't seen his face yet, you still can't imagine the look of a thief with such a high-pitched cadence."
    "小偷轻轻的自言自语， 你有点惊讶他的声音听起来多么愉快， 即使你还没有看到他的脸， 你仍然无法想象 小偷的表情 如此高调的腔调。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_1a2d8ee1:

    # "You are more certain that the thief has continued on his way now, you sigh a breath of relief silently, and you continue following the man."
    "你更确定 小偷继续走在路上 你默默地叹息一口气 继续跟着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_25116a59:

    # "This time you are a hundred percent careful, and certain that no twigs can make you fumble the mission now, so you ready your items and weapons, in case the target confronts you any time soon."
    "这次你百分百小心， 并且肯定没有树枝可以让你现在 破坏任务， 所以你准备你的物品和武器， 以防目标很快会遇到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_cedec611:

    # "Luckily, he doesn't, he doesn't even seem to notice your presence, just walking forward, towards somewhere outside of the farm."
    "幸好他没有，他甚至没注意到你的存在 只是走过去，走向农场外面的某个地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_3fbc407b:

    # "You wish to continue, but he's walking further and further away from Jog and Arthur's territories. There's just too much uncertainty."
    "你想继续，但他越来越远 远离乔格和亚瑟的领地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_9e72999d:

    # "You figured out that Jog and Arthur were right, there's no reason for you to venture outside the farm."
    "你发现乔格和亚瑟是对的 你没有理由去农场外面冒险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a08d91d3:

    # "Plus, you may get caught out there, and no one could have helped you."
    "再说，你可能在那里被抓了 没人能帮你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_bfd33d72:

    # "The thief doesn't even know he's being followed, perhaps another time you'll just catch him red-handed."
    "小偷甚至不知道他被跟踪 也许下次你只会把他当场抓走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_7650dd0e:

    # "Regardless, you give up your pursuit and return to Lusterfield."
    "无论如何,你放弃追逐 回到乐斯民菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a2ee38f0:

    # "You decide to follow him out of the farm, he still doesn't notice your presence in the farm, and by the way you sneak past the grass, you might be able to confront him when he takes a rest."
    "你决定跟着他离开农场 他还是没注意到你出现在农场里 顺便说一下 你溜过草地 可能就能在他休息时面对他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_5b1313b2:

    # "He walks out of the field very quickly, and you peek over, just to see who this grey figure really is."
    "他很快地走出了田野， 你偷看， 只是想看看这个灰色的模样到底是谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_b5115812:

    # "You raise your head, from the back of the thief, he looks like... a rat, with a pair of round ears and thin tails."
    "你抬起你的头，从贼的背部， 他看起来像…… 一只老鼠， 长着一对圆耳朵和细尾巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_69abd296:

    # "He is covered in fur clothing, a leather mask and hard fabric covering his face."
    "他身着毛衣、皮面罩和遮盖面部的硬布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_fb170082:

    # "Definitely someone that walks sneakily, just like Jog usually does."
    "绝对有人偷偷摸摸地走路 就像乔格通常那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_4e49b14a:

    # "Leaving the field, your means of camouflage is rendered obsolete, he is walking towards the green plains, and there's no way you can hide in plain sight..."
    "离开田野，你的伪装手段已经过时， 他正在走向绿平原， 而且没有办法你可以隐藏 在普通的眼中……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_cfbd084a:

    # "You decide to wait it out, just for the rat thief to walk far away from you, and you tails him loosely, often taking advantage of small hills as cover."
    "你决定等待它出来， 只是让老鼠小偷 走远离你， 你跟踪他松散， 经常利用小山做掩护。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_6703dc96:

    # "And luckily, he doesn't ever turn back, just tossing his stolen plums around like a circus show."
    "幸运的是，他从不回头， 像马戏团一样 扔掉他偷来的梅子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_46ac16a3:

    # "You continue walking for a long time..."
    "你继续走很长一段时间……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a552d4cb:

    # "Soon, the thief arrives at a large hideout. He casually moves inside, looks around and closes the door."
    "小偷很快来到一个大藏身处，他随意移动内部，环顾四周，关上门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_bb6f064f:

    # "There're flags just floating around the stone building, with dried red paint all over the cloth."
    "墙上布满了红漆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_6da93bea:

    # "No one's watching the door..."
    "没有人在看门……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_9b345628:

    # "You try to get close, listening in on whatever is happening inside."
    "你试着接近 倾听里面发生的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a20cefa7_3:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_fdab432e:

    # sbd "Got the plums?"
    sbd "拿到梅子了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d2c9e120:

    # "You hear a gruff voice from the other side of the wall. It is certainly not from the thief you were following."
    "你听到墙另一边的恶声音，你所跟踪的不是小偷的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_e67370e4:

    # rbd "Here are the plums, boss."
    rbd "这是李子，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_c2ef9b75:

    # rbd "Almost got eaten alive by that scarecrow."
    rbd "差点被稻草人活活吃掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d5125083:

    # rbd "I think the farmers noticed, I've heard footsteps coming back, maybe we shouldn't go there again."
    rbd "我想农夫们注意到了 我听到脚步声回来了 也许我们不该再去那里了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a1983bcd:

    # sbd "Who cares what they think- The hyena's got our back."
    sbd "谁在乎他们怎么想 土狼在支持我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_6786a57e:

    # "The hyena...? Was he talking about Jog?"
    "土狼……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2a859e1d:

    # sbd "I'm gonna beat your ass hard if you don't come back with a handful of plums next time."
    sbd "如果你不下次再带小李子回来 我就狠狠揍你一顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_9bf1ec71:

    # rbd "Yes, boss."
    rbd "是的，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_1c76f4ef:

    # "The bandit with a gruff noise begins chomping on the plums, making loud noises across the room."
    "山贼带着怪异的噪音 开始在梅子上大摇大摆 房间对面发出响亮的噪音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_c763195c:

    # rbd "Where are the others?"
    rbd "其他人在哪里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_4ca31baa:

    # sbd "We've got some drifters out there, they're handling them."
    sbd "外面有流浪者，他们正在处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_59245112:

    # rbd "Are they all gone? I didn't know we are on patrol today."
    rbd "他们都走了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_938f7c15:

    # sbd "Everyone else all knew, I just told you to get plums for me, clodhopper."
    sbd "其他人都知道，我刚刚告诉你 给我买梅子，土拨鼠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_256cc3de:

    # sbd "Maybe if you stayed quiet and didn't spoil our plan last time I'd trust you with our shit."
    sbd "也许如果你保持安静 并且没有破坏我们的计划 上次我会信任你 用我们的狗屎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ff612c87:

    # rbd "Boss! Last time was a mistake, I won't disappoint you again."
    rbd "老板，上次是错的，我不会再让你失望了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_8e61fb37:

    # rbd "I promise!"
    rbd "我保证！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_25ef101a:

    # "You can hear a loud sigh."
    "你可以听到大声的叹息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_226a1387:

    # sbd "It's still early, you should join them."
    sbd "现在还早 你应该加入他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ea2bbaa5:

    # rbd "Do I get to keep my share of the gold?"
    rbd "我能保留我那份金子吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2a8f6f04:

    # sbd "Half the share."
    sbd "一半份额。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_9bf1ec71_1:

    # rbd "Yes, boss."
    rbd "是的，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_9dbd49e3:

    # "You hear the sound of the thief promptly leaving the hideout, and you quickly hide behind another wall before he sees you."
    "你听到贼的声音 迅速离开藏身之处， 你很快躲在墙后面 之前，他看到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_01cd8aab:

    # "You sigh a breath of relief, and remember what his boss talked about... Jog. He wouldn't betray the farm's interest for them, right?"
    "记得他的老板说过什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_9e121e14:

    # "And Jog was the one that got his plums stolen, he was the one that sends you on this mission in the first place."
    "乔格就是那个把李子偷走的人 他就是那个派你去执行这项任务的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_14fe1d5b:

    # "There's no way he is complicit with a group of bandits."
    "他不可能是一伙匪徒的同谋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_688ed111:

    # "But it does explain why he was so hesitant to share his information with you."
    "但这确实解释了为什么他如此犹豫不决 与你分享他的信息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_46bfc09e:

    # "But, what if Sebas was right about him?"
    "但如果塞巴斯对他的看法是对的呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_97d04ca4:

    # "You're still pondering the possibility, but a window flying in your face snaps you out of the train of thoughts completely."
    "你仍在思考可能性 但一扇窗扇在你脸上 让你完全摆脱了思想的轨迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d026e418:

    # "SMACK-"
    "SMACK-"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_87f71252:

    # "The window pane slaps you pretty hard, and you are not quick enough to react before the bandit boss peeks out of it."
    "窗帘扇得你耳光很重 你不够快 在土匪老大偷窥之前反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_38505796:

    # "A shark's face comes staring right at you, he is covered in leather armor, giving you a weird glance."
    "鲨鱼的脸正盯着你， 他全身都是皮甲， 让你一眼怪怪的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_8d39d845:

    # sbd "Who the hell are you?"
    sbd "你到底是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_61d6eaff:

    # "It takes a few seconds for you to process that you've been caught, you are still pressing on the back of your head."
    "需要几秒钟你才能处理 你被抓了，你还在脑后按住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_6b6aa51f:

    # e "I'm just passing by this place, taking off now."
    e "我只是路过这个地方， 起飞了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_3e49f9b6:

    # sbd "Not so easy."
    sbd "不是那么容易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_71abbefe:

    # e "Well, you caught me... "
    e "你抓住我……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_bc8850bd:

    # sbd "I did."
    sbd "我做到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_c9ab8aa0:

    # e "I... uh... am new, bandit recruit, boss."
    e "我…… 呃…… 是新来的 土匪新兵 老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2be8f457:

    # "The shark squints his eyes."
    "鲨鱼斜视他的眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_90df77e3:

    # sbd "Hmm... you look like someone I've seen before..."
    sbd "嗯…… 你看起来像我见过的人……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_e69ff1cb:

    # e "Of course, it's because I'm the new recruit, boss."
    e "当然，因为我是新招的，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2008dba9:

    # "Suddenly, the shark's eyes widen, feinting a smile of realization."
    "突然，鲨鱼的眼睛变宽了， 微笑地微笑着意识到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_c03c2f5e:

    # sbd "N-no! Now I know, you're the adventurer that broke into our camp earlier! Think you can fool me?"
    sbd "我知道了，你以前是冒险家 闯进我们营地的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_82738f6b:

    # e "U-uh... no I'm not."
    e "U -uh…… 不，我不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_dcfe58a8:

    # sbd "New? We haven't had any new recruits for a while."
    sbd "新兵 我们很久没有新兵了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a8882e4e:

    # e "Did the others not tell you about me? I'm really good at taking... people's things, boss."
    e "其他人没告诉你我的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_762beba4:

    # "The shark looks at you with a face full of confusion."
    "鲨鱼用满脸混乱的表情看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_add45ee7:

    # sbd "I don't recall any goats being a new recruit... well, you know what you should bring me... right?"
    sbd "我不记得有山羊当新兵…… 你知道你应该带什么给我…… 对不对？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_1a1a0268:

    # e "Bring you?"
    e "带你们来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_50f35578:

    # "He points at his belly, and the surroundings."
    "他指着肚子和周围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_bd165e37:

    # sbd "Everyone of us know."
    sbd "我们每个人都知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2bbad634:

    # "You prepare to run away from the bandit, but the shark just jumps across the window."
    "你准备逃离强盗 但鲨鱼跳过窗户。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_e07e7663:

    # "He lands right next to you, holding an axe over his shoulder."
    "他就在你旁边降落， 握着斧头在他的肩膀上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_8b432430:

    # "You walk a few steps backwards, your body is trembling, the shark bandit is extremely bulky as compared to you."
    "你退后几步，身体在颤抖 鲨鱼盗贼比你大得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_fc7e010e:

    # sbd "A walking bag of gold, huh?"
    sbd "一袋金子，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d586b4b0:

    # sbd "Now, hand over everything, traveler."
    sbd "现在，把所有东西都交出来，旅行者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_1f7a14c1:

    # e "Here's your... rose, boss."
    e "这是你的…… 玫瑰，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_8e2d60da:

    # sbd "The fuck is this?"
    sbd "这是他妈的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_de8a833e:

    # sbd "You wanna propose or something?"
    sbd "你想求婚还是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_13e46657:

    # e "Here's your meat, boss."
    e "这是你的肉，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_c6468503:

    # sbd "Ugh, meat?"
    sbd "啊，肉？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_7daeb877:

    # e "Here's the blue berry you need."
    e "这是你需要的蓝莓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_15f4af97:

    # sbd "What?"
    sbd "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_7e5be565:

    # e "What?"
    e "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_512ab907:

    # sbd "You're kidding."
    sbd "你在开玩笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_f9e2f36d:

    # e "Here's the apple."
    e "这是苹果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_96bc7f03:

    # sbd "That looks like the plums I have here."
    sbd "看起来像我这里的李子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_8a91b2c4:

    # e "Here's your iron, boss."
    e "这是你的铁，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_e5ed05bb:

    # sbd "What's this, you think I'm a smither?"
    sbd "这是什么，你以为我是铁匠？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_e5742a86:

    # e "Here's the gold, I have 100 of them, boss."
    e "这是金子，我有100个，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_d1016510:

    # sbd "T-that's a pathetic amount of gold."
    sbd "- 这金子真可怜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_8462dda4:

    # e "Here's the cashmere you need, boss."
    e "这是你要的羊绒，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_786db37a:

    # sbd "What the fuck is the use of these."
    sbd "这玩意他妈的怎么用？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_5bd3d78f:

    # e "It's for knitting, boss."
    e "这是用来编织的，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_d0acf6f5:

    # sbd "You think I'm here to fucking knit a sweater for you like an old grandma?"
    sbd "你以为我是来给你织毛衣的吗？ 像一个老奶奶一样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_f29dc1e6:

    # e "Uh... Sorry B-boss... I do not have anything ready, yet."
    e "呃 对不起 B -boss 我还没准备好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_9028e2d4:

    # sbd "Nothing?"
    sbd "什么也没有？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_ebe65b0e:

    # "The shark scratches his chin, his impatient look is beginning to worry you."
    "鲨鱼抓着他的下巴 他的不耐烦的表情开始让你担心了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_b8fea578:

    # sbd "Well that means you don't know shit about us then."
    sbd "那意味着你对我们一无所知。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_e07e7663:

    # "He lands right next to you, holding an axe over his shoulder."
    "他就在你旁边降落， 握着斧头在他的肩膀上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_8b432430:

    # "You walk a few steps backwards, your body is trembling, the shark bandit is extremely bulky as compared to you."
    "你退后几步，身体在颤抖 鲨鱼盗贼比你大得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_fc7e010e:

    # sbd "A walking bag of gold, huh?"
    sbd "一袋金子，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_d586b4b0:

    # sbd "Now, hand over everything, traveler."
    sbd "现在，把所有东西都交出来，旅行者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_ff3b5c9f:

    # sbd "Whatever, it looks fresh red, that's good enough."
    sbd "不管怎么说，它看起来新鲜红， 足够好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_d9e25c51:

    # e "Fresh red?"
    e "新鲜红色？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_a01e09a4:

    # sbd "Yeah, red food. Did you not know what you were bringing?"
    sbd "红色食物 你不知道你带了什么来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_2a20d799:

    # e "Uh... yes of course, red food, right. I love blood, and stealing people's hard-earned food!"
    e "当然有 红菜 我喜欢血 偷人辛苦赚来的食物！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_c2ebdbab:

    # e "May I ask whose are the blood on the flags outside?"
    e "请问外面国旗上的血是谁的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_5c93c78d:

    # sbd "Blood? We don't do blood here."
    sbd "血？我们不在这里流血。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_050072d0:

    # sbd "It's food paint, we're not killing travelers left and right just to paint these fucking flags."
    sbd "这是食品涂料， 我们不是杀旅行者 左右和右 只涂这些他妈的旗帜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_8e1f59ef:

    # sbd "But they do scare off a few of those pesky local heroes trying to prove their worth."
    sbd "但他们确实吓跑了 少数那些卑劣的当地英雄 试图证明他们的价值。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_45c3dd6f:

    # sbd "Also, why are you asking?"
    sbd "还有，你为什么问？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_7567a411:

    # e "Uh, just curious, boss."
    e "呃，只是好奇，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_14895990:

    # sbd "Suspicious, but well. You've passed my test, which is the official one, not the riddles those goons been doing."
    sbd "你通过了我的测试，这是正式的测试， 而不是那些家伙做的谜题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_337d2d60:

    # e "Thank you, boss."
    e "谢谢，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_81310a5e:

    # sbd "Now, go out and patrol, or whatever you were doing."
    sbd "现在，出去巡逻，或者你在做什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_e2a62376:

    # sbd "Don't stand here again. Next time I open the window it's gonna smash your face in."
    sbd "下次我打开窗户时，你的脸会被打碎的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_c140f559:

    # sbd "And bring me some red food when you get them."
    sbd "等你们拿到红菜后再给我拿来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_8b6587d6:

    # e "Got it, boss."
    e "明白了，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_024429c4:

    # "The shark returns back inside the hideout, he casually sits on the table with the newly acquired plums and other food."
    "鲨鱼回到藏身处里 他随随便便坐到桌上 拿着新买的李子和其他食物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_cb25db42:

    # "You stare at the bandit boss, he's just munching down on the food like you're not here."
    "你盯着土匪老大看 他就在吃东西 就像你不在一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_6e23df8b:

    # "But he quickly picks up on your glare."
    "但是他很快地抓住了你的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_83ffded4:

    # sbd "Get lost, meathead."
    sbd "滚开，猪头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_b4120b98:

    # "You take your leave, and run away as fast as you can. The shark doesn't seem to mind that though."
    "你离开后 尽快逃跑 鲨鱼似乎并不在意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_82e16557:

    # "What just happened...? Everything happened so quickly..."
    "刚才发生了什么 发生得太快了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_2922413b:

    # "Are you a bandit now? That doesn't sound like a proper bandit initiation, but to be honest, you aren't sure how bandits are recruited either."
    "你现在是土匪了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_2639284c:

    # "He does seem to believe you are a bandit..."
    "他似乎相信你是土匪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_be70da55:

    # "Perhaps you can return here later to see if the shark recognised you..."
    "也许你以后可以回到这里 看看鲨鱼是否认出你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_80051a5f:

    # "It... would be extremely unlikely that you'd willingly return here though."
    "你不可能愿意回到这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_ccc46f4b:

    # "...and."
    "……and."

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_72fd962f:

    # "Plums. You still haven't stopped the thief, yet. Perhaps you'd have to catch him red-handed later."
    "你还没阻止小偷，也许你以后得把他抓走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_b7ab094e:

    # "You return to the farm with thoughts about the bandits along the way."
    "你回到农场时，对路上的土匪有想法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Fail_3c02012e:

    # e "B-boss n-no...I-"
    e "B -boss n -no……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Fail_19727bee:

    # sbd "You're clearly either deaf or aren't my bandit."
    sbd "你显然不是聋子就是不是我的土匪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Fail_0a3d2a8c:

    # sbd "In both case you're dead!"
    sbd "在两种情况下你都死了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Fail_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Fail_5fd8e39d:

    # sbd "Dead-f..."
    sbd "死……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_db97f52c:

    # "As you touch the flute, your vision suddenly darkens as new memories flood your mind."
    "当你触摸笛子时，你的幻觉突然暗淡起来， 新的记忆淹没了你的脑海。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ecca64bc:

    # "Jog lounged atop a pile of hay, twirling his flute absentmindedly, his gaze distant."
    "乔格在一堆干草旁休息， 轻轻地转动他的长笛，他视线遥远。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_cb0501d9:

    # a "This is a death wish, Lot. You cannot go through with it."
    a "这是死亡愿望 洛特 你不能接受它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_2b2c6b39:

    # "Lothar, perched on a tree stump, waved off the warning with a grin."
    "洛萨尔,在树桩上游荡, 微笑地挥舞着警示。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_8f202aae:

    # l "Don't underestimate me, Amble. I'm the hero of Lusterfield! A few bandits won't stop me!"
    l "别低估我,安布,我是乐斯民菲尔德的英雄 几个土匪阻止不了我！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_18321fc6:

    # "The wolf declared, his voice was brimming with confidence. Amble rose from the wall, shaking his head."
    "狼声响起，声音充满信心，从墙上摇晃头部，从墙上冒出一朵明亮的玫瑰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_d7497d25:

    # a "That's the problem, Lot. We're not in Lusterfield anymore. If they catch you off guard for even one second, I don't know who can even save you."
    a "这就是问题所在,罗特,我们不在乐斯民菲尔德了 如果他们一秒钟就抓到你 我都不知道谁能救你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_f72f6088:

    # l "You worry too much, Amble. I will easily make them pay for what they did to our village."
    l "你太担心了,安布,我会轻易让他们付出代价。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_2afbaea6:

    # l "The villagers looked up to me, did you know how much they fawned over me after I said it'd be an easy job?"
    l "村民们仰望我，你知道我说这工作很简单后， 他们把我养了多少吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_38ce7f10:

    # l "I can't let them down after that. Plus, those bandit are just a few stealing thieves, what can even go wrong?"
    l "再说，那些土匪只是小偷，还有什么能犯的错？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_26021b0d:

    # "Amble sighed, he tried to reason with Lothar, but he couldn't find a word."
    "叹息了,他试图和洛萨尔讲道理 但他一个字都找不到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_6e7231ff:

    # l "Hey, Jog, you coming or what?"
    l "嘿，乔格，你来不来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_3b1b6731:

    # "Lothar turned away from the big guy to face the lounging hyena."
    "洛萨尔从那个大块头转身 面对那个懒洋洋的土狼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_4eb0de49:

    # "They briefly exchanged a gaze, and Jog leaped onto the fence, spinning the flute once more before tucking it into his belt."
    "乔格跳上栅栏， 再把笛子转动一次，然后塞进他的腰带。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_c2f1d372:

    # j "Sure... You'll need me to scout anyway, so let's get this done before the night comes."
    j "当然，你需要我侦察，所以让我们在晚上到来之前完成这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_a9e543b0:

    # "Lothar grinned, his eyes gleaming."
    "洛萨尔笑着 他的眼睛闪闪发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_eacd4199:

    # l "I knew you'd come through! If only Amble here would stop being such a fucking prick."
    l "我就知道你会挺过来！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_27ac3608:

    # l "Guess we'll leave without you then, Amble. Us two will handle this the grown-men way, and maybe we'll even bring you back a piece of that shark meat."
    l "我们两个会用大人的方式处理这事 也许我们还会把鲨鱼肉带回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_42dffa7c:

    # "Amble shook his head, he opened his mouth briefly, but Lothar is already walking away from the village."
    "安布摇头,他张开嘴,但洛萨尔已经离开村庄了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_43339e0b:

    # a "Jog, this isn't safe. You know that, right?"
    a "乔格，这不安全 你知道的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_5495a5e8:

    # "The logger called out to Jog, who was already halfway to the gate."
    "伐木者叫了约格，他已经到大门一半了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_1e75eda6:

    # "Jog turned, blocking Lothar's view, and whispered in the bear's ear."
    "乔格转过身 挡住Lottar的观点 在熊耳朵里低语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_a5e0074e:

    # j "Trust me, Amble. I'll keep him safe. He won't ever set foot inside that bandit fort."
    j "相信我,安布,我会保护他的安全 他绝不会踏进那个强盗堡垒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_fb42b0df:

    # j "Not ever..."
    j "永远不要……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_30885a14:

    # "Jog put on his devious smile, before turning around and catching up to Lothar."
    "乔格戴上他狡猾的笑容 在转过身去追上洛萨尔之前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_4a2ab6a1:

    # "The two set off toward the bandits' hideout, trodding past the green grass up the hills."
    "两人朝匪徒的藏身之处出发 穿过山上绿草。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_d313548b:

    # j "So, Lothar."
    j "那么,洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_1d864c60:

    # j "What's your master plan when we reach their place? Charge in, sword swinging, and hope for the best?"
    j "我们到了他们的位置，你有什么总计划？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_20ad644e:

    # "Jog twirled his bow between his fingers."
    "乔格把弓扭在手指之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_d8073462:

    # "Lothar laughed, striding on the tall grass confidently."
    "洛萨尔笑了 满怀信心地爬到高草地上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_f191581c:

    # l "Something like that, Jog. I know they're not expecting us, and I can take them by surprise."
    l "我知道他们没在等我们，我可以给他们惊喜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_f2c763b7:

    # l "You'll be my eyes and ears, right? Make a distraction while I slip in and take down their boss."
    l "你是我的耳目，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_27f669b1:

    # "He clapped a hand on Jog's shoulder, nearly knocking him off balance."
    "他拍了乔格的肩膀 差点把他打得天花乱坠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_f7b6b963:

    # "The hyena scowled silently."
    "土狼默默地被埋伏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_d9916fcb:

    # j "Is this the famous origin of the Hero of Lusterfield? Sneaking into the most guarded camp without getting caught?"
    j "这是著名的乐斯民菲尔德英雄的起源吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_99d42065:

    # l "Exactly! I'll take their leader's head, and the rest will scatter like rats."
    l "没错，我砍下他们的头 剩下的会像老鼠一样散开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_7af35009:

    # j "Oh, right. You must be somehow walking stealthier than I do."
    j "哦，对了，你一定比我更隐形。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_10d69e56:

    # "Jog couldn't help but furrowed his brow awkwardly. This was all too reckless, even for Lothar. But he played along nonetheless."
    "乔格忍不住把眉毛拖得尴尬，这太鲁莽了，即使对Lotthar来说也是如此，但他还是跟着玩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_3cead8bc:

    # "On any other day, he would laugh in front of Lothar's face, and tell him how stupid he was."
    "有一天,他会当着洛萨尔的面笑 告诉他他有多蠢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_a338be98:

    # "But this time, the wolf was stubborn enough to go through with it, and it made him utterly irked."
    "但这次，狼很固执 足以通过它， 它使他完全受到刺激。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ca0a41b0:

    # "Jog sighed, his eyes scanning the horizon. The green meadow stretched out before them, a sea of swaying weed."
    "乔格 叹息、 他 的 眼目 照亮 地平线。 绿草地 伸展 在 他 們面前、 是 摇摆 的 海。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_4b6aa44b:

    # "They are not far from the bandit's camp now, the only thing between them was the vast plain of Prattlefell."
    "他们现在离强盗的营地不远， 他们之间唯一的事情就是 一片大片的普拉特费尔平原。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ae00dcf5:

    # j "I'm going to scout ahead."
    j "我要向前侦察。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_f81e5dd7:

    # l "Wait-"
    l "Wait-"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_82a383fb:

    # j "Just stay here Lot. It won't be long."
    j "待在这里，洛特，不会太久的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_974be182:

    # "Before Lothar could respond, Jog had already slipped away into the tall grass, his form quickly disappearing from view."
    "在洛萨尔回应之前 乔格已经溜进了高草地 他的身体迅速消失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_0e34ccb0:

    # l "Now I'm stuck here waiting... great!"
    l "现在我被困在这里等待…… 太好了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_27eb1d4b:

    # "Lothar stood alone on the path, tapping his foot impatiently, his hand resting on the hilt of his sword."
    "路边的洛萨尔独自站着 毫无耐心地拍他的脚 手躺在剑的脚上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_3fb8b88d:

    # l "How dare he allowed a hero like me to wait for him, what a witless brat."
    l "他竟敢让我这样的英雄等他 真是个无才的小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_69b6a52f:

    # "As the hero continued to rant, Jog climbed a nearby tree, using its branches to get a better view of the surrounding."
    "乔格爬上附近一棵树， 利用树枝更好地观察周围环境。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_fbb71411:

    # "He crouched low, peering through the leaves to spot any signs of the bandits, but all he could see was the endless expanse of grass."
    "他蹲低了，通过树叶观察 发现任何土匪的痕迹 但他所看到的只是无尽的草地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_871a6f63:

    # "A grin spread across his face as he spotted something else, a flicker of movement in the distance."
    "笑容在脸上张开 他发现别的东西 距离上移动的闪烁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_e06162b8:

    # j "There they are."
    j "他们在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_882e0347:

    # "Jog glances at the clueless wolf standing alone amidst the tall grass, his fingers brushed the flute at his belt, and he pulled it free."
    "看着无知的狼 独自站在高高的草地上 他的手指把笛子刷在腰带上 然后他把它拔了出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_1127983c:

    # "He brought it to his lips, hesitating for a moment, then, softly, he began to play."
    "他把它带到嘴唇上，犹豫了一会儿， 然后，轻轻地，他开始玩耍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_92c1aee5:

    # "Slowly but surely, a long, grueling whine could be heard, as if it was a wild creature's calling to his mates."
    "慢慢地，但肯定， 能够听到一个漫长的，苦不堪言的哀号， 仿佛它是一个野兽的召唤 他的伴侣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_495e7053:

    # "Lothar's ears perked up at the strange, yipping sound. He raised his head, trying to locate the source."
    "洛萨尔的耳朵被奇怪的 刺耳的声音敲响了起来 他抬起头 试图找到源头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_1f3ee005:

    # l "Jog?"
    l "乔格？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_fd8cdad1:

    # "His claws unsheathed, sword tightly held in hand, eyes darting as he searched for any sign of danger."
    "他的爪子解开，剑紧紧握在手上，眼睛在探寻任何危险迹象时溜达。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_19eed26b:

    # "The yipping grew louder, more frantic, and Lothar's heart raced. He could feel the tension in the air, the anticipation of a fight."
    "摩擦越大,越发疯狂,洛萨尔的心越发激动。他可以感觉到空气中的紧张,以及一场战斗的预期。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_eef5c7b9:

    # l "Who's there? Show yourself."
    l "谁在那里？你现身吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_194318ad:

    # "Jog hid behind the leaves, he watched Lothar's every move as he put away the flute."
    "乔格躲在叶子后面 他看着Lottar的一举一动 拿走长笛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_9b960be6:

    # "It was dangerous to put his own friend in a situation like this, but Lothar was too reckless, too stubborn to listen to reason, he thought."
    "将自己的朋友置于这种境地是很危险的， 但是Lotthar太鲁莽，太固执， 听不到理性，他认为。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_8fdb9e69:

    # "Maybe this will teach him a lesson."
    "也许这能给他一个教训。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_0b6483b2:

    # "Soon, a group of gnolls followed the voice of the flute to the clearing, their eyes locked on to the hero wolf."
    "很快，一群精灵跟着笛子的声音 来到清空的地方，他们的眼睛紧紧盯着英雄狼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_8f316dbd:

    # l "What the- Where did yall come from?"
    l "什么 - - 是什么声音从哪儿来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_12b486ac:

    # l "No matter, just a few small fries like you won't stop me!"
    l "随便啦，你这样小的炸薯条也阻止不了我！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_96754ae0:

    # "He roared, readying himself for battle."
    "他咆哮，准备战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_f666b560:

    # "The gnolls stared at him intently, saliva dripping from their maws."
    "鼻孔盯着他， 口水滴从他们的马头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_7c26f639:

    # "The leader gnoll stepped forward, his eyes fixed on the wolf before it."
    "头目Gnol站了起来， 他的眼睛在狼之前固定住它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_222e884b:

    # gnl "Need help, pup?"
    gnl "需要帮助吗，小狗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_5f139400:

    # "He growled, and Lothar's eyes widened in shock."
    "他咆哮,洛萨尔的眼睛在震动中睁大了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_6c263708:

    # l "Who are you calling a pup, damn it! I am the mighty Lothar, hero of Lusterfield!"
    l "你叫谁小狗,妈的,我是伟大的洛萨尔,乐斯民菲尔德的英雄!"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_8096c687:

    # "The gnolls laughed, pointing at the annoyed face of Lothar."
    "凝胶笑着 指着洛萨尔的烦恼脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_60d9e210:

    # gnl "Lotta? Gnolls know lotta folks, but no know such name."
    gnl "诺尔斯认识洛塔人 但不知道这个名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_dccf6189:

    # "They growled menacingly, circling around him."
    "他们大肆咆哮，环绕着他盘旋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_594a4fda:

    # "Lothar backed up slowly, keeping a wary eye on them."
    "洛萨尔慢慢地退缩 盯着他们小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_93aae193:

    # l "Such arrogant beasts... Fine, have it your way!"
    l "这么傲慢的野兽……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ed8f38be:

    # "He unsheathed his sword, ready to fight back."
    "他解开剑，准备反击。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_68c4a6c5:

    # gnl "Gnolls' way?"
    gnl "\"Gnolls' 的方式？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_00d27f10:

    # "The leader gnoll chuckled, and the rest of them jeered amongst themselves."
    "领袖格诺尔 紧紧锁着， 其余的人 互相嘲弄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_089b240b:

    # gnl "We chase Lotta."
    gnl "我们追逐洛塔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_36c025e0:

    # "Suddenly, the gnolls scattered, disappearing into the tall grass."
    "忽然间，花圈散落，消失在高草丛中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_7156972d:

    # l "What the hell are these little wimps doing?"
    l "这些小懦夫到底在干嘛？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_315764cc:

    # "He muttered, unsure of what to do next."
    "他自言自语 不知下一步该怎么办。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_db964e4d:

    # l "Show yourselves, evil creatures! Fight me like a real man."
    l "邪恶的动物们，给我现身吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_09b58fa0:

    # "He shouted, but there was no response."
    "他大喊大叫，但没有得到回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_b6f77fd1:

    # "He felt a chill run down his spine as he realized that he was truly alone, facing a group of wild gnolls that seemed to be playing a dangerous game with him."
    "他发现自己真的孤独， 面对一群似乎和他玩危险游戏的野兽， 他感到寒冷，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_d380e28b:

    # l "You guys better watch out, this is not a joke, I am going to-"
    l "你们最好小心点，这不是开玩笑，我要……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_a2d76d41:

    # "Lothar couldn't finish his sentence as he felt something poking his ass."
    "洛萨尔无法完成刑期 因为他觉得有东西戳他屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_2884b236:

    # l "Ouch! What the..."
    l "哎哟！什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_c6a05c69:

    # "He turned around and saw a gnoll, laughing at him."
    "他转过身，看到一个小精灵，嘲笑他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_b09479da:

    # gnl "Haha... Lotta no like that?"
    gnl "哈哈……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_02be06e8:

    # "It taunted, and Lothar turned red with anger."
    "它被嘲弄, 洛萨尔变得红 愤怒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ab492302:

    # l "I will make you regret that!"
    l "我会让你后悔的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_92a1211d:

    # "He shouted as he swung his sword at the wild hyena, but another gnoll appeared, swatting his sword away."
    "他向野生土狼挥舞剑时大喊大叫，但又出现了另一个小矮人，挥舞他的剑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_59fccfea:

    # gnl "Not so fast, pup."
    gnl "不要太快，小狗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ee76db88:

    # "It snarled as the sword toppled on the ground."
    "它像剑一样在地上被砍倒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_af7787a6:

    # j "Lot, I'm back!"
    j "洛萨尔，我回来了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_d2f7155e:

    # "Jog called, shaking Lothar awake."
    "乔格打电话来 摇摇着Lotthar醒过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_b9cd4c3d:

    # j "Almost didn't make it back alive, those damn bandits found me, and I had to lead them on a wild chase."
    j "那些该死的匪徒发现我 我不得不带领他们去追逐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_654277e4:

    # "The hyena yawned, stretching his arms."
    "土狼打起手来，伸展手臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_4fd604cb:

    # l "What, it's been hours! Where were you? You left me alone out here!"
    l "都几个小时了 你去哪了 你把我一个人丢在外面了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_be397563:

    # "Lothar snapped, rubbing his eyes."
    "洛萨尔突然崩溃 摸他的眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_89573879:

    # j "Sorry Lot, but you know how it is. Can't let the bandits catch me, can I?"
    j "对不起，洛萨尔，但你知道的，不能让强盗抓住我，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_1080e5c1:

    # "Jog shrugged, lying down next to him."
    "乔格摇晃着，躺在他旁边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ca23e364:

    # j "So, were you waiting this whole time... naked?"
    j "你一直在等…… 裸体吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_51a96c50:

    # "He teased, nudging Lothar with his foot. Lothar scowled, looking away."
    "他嘲弄,用脚勾引洛萨尔,洛萨尔挥舞着,向外望去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_bd176de7:

    # l "None of your business."
    l "不关你的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_e9091985:

    # "He mumbled, standing up and gathering his clothes."
    "他大便，站起来，收拾衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_07304ed6:

    # j "...Fine then, shall we continue to the bandit camp? I'll be extra careful this time around."
    j "那好吧，我们继续去强盗营吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_56546b30:

    # "Jog asked, grinning. Lothar shook his head, putting his clothes on."
    "乔格咧嘴问道。洛萨尔摇摇头，穿上衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_02092cd1:

    # l "No way, that's it for me. I'm going home."
    l "不行，我就这样，我要回家了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_0bf814af:

    # "He declared, heading back towards the village."
    "他宣布返回村庄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_16053970:

    # j "Aw, come on! Don't let those bandits get the best of you!"
    j "别让那些土匪抢走你最好的一面！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_a721e853:

    # "Jog called after him. But Lothar didn't reply, he just kept walking, leaving his friend behind."
    "乔格打电话给他 但Lottar没有回信 他一直走着 丢下朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_672d1c44:

    # "The hyena watched him go, laughing softly to himself as he noticed the wet stain on the back of his pants."
    "土狼看着他走，轻轻地笑自己，因为他注意到裤子后背有湿色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_bbe5f4e3:

    # j "Gotta clean that up later..."
    j "之后得把那里收拾干净……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_993bd2af:

    # "He whispered softly, sheathing the flute into his pocket."
    "他轻轻地低声低语 将笛子塞进口袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_6ad987ce:

    # "A considerable crowd has gathered all around the carousal. Drinks and snacks are being passed around, the air thick with the smell of roasted meat, spiced ale, and festival excitement."
    "大批群众聚集在旋转木马周围， 饮料和零食在四周流传，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_b9806eb9:

    # "At the center of the tents stands a large makeshift stage, lit by floating orbs and flickering bonfires. In the middle of it, a short, hooded rabbit stands proudly, cape billowing even though there's barely any wind."
    "帐篷中央搭着一座大型临时舞台，漂浮的光球和摇曳的篝火照亮台面。舞台中央，一只戴兜帽的矮小兔子骄傲地站着；明明几乎没有风，他的斗篷却猎猎作响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_89e1af4a:

    # rb "Welcome, welcome everyone, to the grand opening of Ribba's Ribald Magic Show!"
    rb "欢迎大家 欢迎各位光临 里巴的里巴魔术秀的开场！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_820c1a87:

    # rb "Tonight, your twitchy little host will dazzle you with the most wondrous, the most marvelous, the most downright lewd feats of magic you've ever seen!"
    rb "今晚，你那颤抖的小宿主 将会用你见过的最神奇 最神奇，最神奇的 最下流的淫荡的魔术 使你惊艳！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_3d7e9af9:

    # "The rabbit's voice is surprisingly loud for his size, carrying easily across the meadow. Despite his height - or maybe because of the cheeky confidence - he commands the entire crowd's attention, yours included."
    "兔子的声音因体型大小而出奇地响亮，很容易穿过草原。 尽管他身高很高，或者可能是因为他无比自信，他还是吸引了整个人群的注意力，包括你的注意力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_99b0f646:

    # "You stand near the back, craning your neck to get a better view as he begins waving his wand with theatrical sweeps."
    "你站在后面 脖子弯曲着想看得更清楚 当他开始挥舞魔杖 进行戏剧扫荡时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_db24c24a:

    # rb "For my first trick... I shall make this very wand disappear right before your eager eyes!"
    rb "为了我的第一个把戏 我要在你的渴望面前 使这魔杖消失！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_589b7dd5:

    # "With a dramatic flourish, he snaps his fingers."
    "有了戏剧性的繁荣，他断了手指。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_a1938130:

    # rb "Boof!"
    rb "Boof！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_5349152c:

    # "In an instant, the wand vanishes from his paw."
    "一瞬间，魔杖从他的爪子上消失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_bfcb1bae:

    # "The crowd gasps, then erupts into applause. You find yourself clapping along as Ribba takes a low, exaggerated bow, ears flopping forward."
    "人群喘气，然后爆发到掌声中。你发现自己在里巴用低、夸大其词的弓头、耳朵往前倒时，拍拍手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_599687d2:

    # rb "Not bad, eh? But we're just warming up!"
    rb "不错吧，不过我们只是热身而已！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_2c72083d:

    # "He grins wide, showing a flash of sharp little teeth."
    "他笑得满脸笑容 露出一闪闪的尖锐小牙齿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_2f8d6d90:

    # rb "Next! I shall conjure dozens of the juiciest carrots... straight from the depths of my mysterious hood!"
    rb "接下来我要从我神秘兜帽的深处……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_135d7dec:

    # "The rabbit opens his mouth wide-impossibly wide-and reaches in with both paws."
    "兔子张开嘴 张开嘴，用两只爪子伸进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_d93831bf:

    # "You watch, half in disbelief, half in morbid fascination, as he pulls out one long, glistening carrot... then another... then another."
    "你看，半在不信中， 一半在病态的迷恋中， 当他拉出一个长长的，闪闪发光的胡萝卜…… 然后另一个……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_79b418a6:

    # "They're slick, coated in saliva, dripping slightly as they pile up on the stage in a messy, suggestive heap."
    "它们浮起来 涂在唾液里 当它们堆积在舞台上 堆积在一片混乱的暗示堆积物中时 微滴滴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_e61fb6dd:

    # "The crowd cheers louder. A few whistles pierce the air, someone in the front row laughs nervously."
    "人群大喊大叫，一些哨子穿透空气，前排有人紧张地笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_9c4a0792:

    # crowd "Was that... actually in his throat the whole time?"
    crowd "那是…… 实际上在他的喉咙 整个时间？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_fef6a367:

    # crowd "No way. It's gotta be hidden somewhere inside the hood, maybe?"
    crowd "不可能，它一定藏在兜帽里某个地方吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_d2d10668:

    # crowd "I don't even care anymore. Keep going!"
    crowd "我甚至都不在乎了 继续！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_d3452b94:

    # "You can't look away. The carrots keep coming, each one wetter than the last, until the pile is almost comically obscene."
    "胡萝卜不断来，每块湿透， 直到堆积物几乎是滑稽的淫秽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_a556a532:

    # "Ribba finally stops, wiping the saliva off his mouth theatrically with the back of his paw."
    "里巴终于停止了， 用他的爪子背部 以戏剧性的方式擦掉嘴里口水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_99e423ea:

    # rb "See? Magic should always leave you a little... moist."
    rb "看吧 魔法总是会让你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_f4a71ccb:

    # "The laughter is louder now, edged with hungrier guffaws."
    "现在笑得更大声了， 充满了饥饿的长毛巾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_0d61595c:

    # "He continues through several more tricks - cards that flutter out of his ears and land on volunteers' laps, illusory contours that traces his plump hips under the thin costume."
    "他继续玩弄其他几个把戏， 玩弄那些从耳朵里掉下来的卡片， 坐在志愿者的腿上， 幻想的轮廓，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_aa97cc62:

    # "And a silk scarf that ties the rabbit tightly against the wall, as it teasingly flutters between his thighs all by itself."
    "和一条丝巾 将兔子紧紧绑在墙上， 当它取笑 在他大腿之间 挥舞着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_c87c26a2:

    # "With each act, the cheers grow rowdier. More drinks are downed. And voices start calling out."
    "欢呼声随着每次表演 越来越响亮 更多的饮料也消沉了 声音开始呼喊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_ac77b526:

    # crowd "Show us something really spicy, bunny!"
    crowd "给我们看点辣辣的，小兔子！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_0970d4b0:

    # crowd "Come on, Ribba! Give us the good stuff!"
    crowd "来啊 里巴 给我们好东西！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_154d395d:

    # "Ribba pauses mid-bow, ears perking straight up. His grin turns sly."
    "里巴 暂停中巴， 耳朵穿直， 他的笑容转来狡猾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_7630fe8f:

    # rb "Oh-ho? My lovely crowds are feeling frisky tonight, aren't they?"
    rb "我可爱的观众今晚感觉很冷淡，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_e2ef5e40:

    # "He hops to the edge of the stage, leaning forward, voice dropping into a teasing purr that still somehow carries to the back."
    "他跳到舞台的边缘， 向前倾斜， 声音落到一个开花的呼噜声中， 仍然不知怎么随波逐流到后面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_da5dbe2d:

    # rb "I hear you. I do. But a magician's got to save the really naughty bits for the encore..."
    rb "我听见了，但是魔术师得把淘气的碎片 保存下来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_08dc35c4:

    # rb "Can't show all my tricks up the sleeves so soon, after all."
    rb "毕竟不能这么快就把我所有的把戏都拿出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_0ba13f07:

    # "He winks directly toward the thicker part of the crowd, though you swear his eyes flick toward you for half a second."
    "他直接对人群中较厚的部分眨眼，尽管你发誓他的眼睛朝你闪了半秒钟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_fd90b2ec:

    # "The murmurs rise, excited and impatient."
    "杂音上升，兴奋和不耐烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_43640fcd:

    # "Still, he straightens up, cape swirling dramatically."
    "即便如此，他还是挺直身子，斗篷戏剧性地旋转起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_a3156639:

    # rb "That's the end of tonight's main show! Thank you all for coming - and for coming so loudly!"
    rb "今晚的主秀到此结束！感谢各位前来——还叫得这么响！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_68742eb8:

    # "The crowd roars with laughter and applause. A few people surge forward, kneeling at the stage edge, reaching up to touch his fluffy feet or the hem of his cape."
    "人群大叫着欢笑和掌声。 有几个人向前冲来，跪在舞台边缘，伸手去摸他的毛毛脚或斗篷的毛毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_8ddf4b61:

    # "Ribba jumps back, swatting their hands away with mock scandal."
    "里巴反弹，用假丑闻打掉他们的手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_4266e435:

    # rb "Ah-ah! That's not included in today's show! It could be in the next one, maybe."
    rb "啊 今天的节目里没有这个内容 也许下一场吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_fc9c6cde:

    # "He gives one last flourishing bow, then hops off the back of the stage in a puff of glittering smoke."
    "他最后给了最后一首欣欣向荣的鞠躬 然后在一股闪闪发光的烟雾中跳下舞台的后台。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_49d5bcdb:

    # "The crowd slowly disperses, buzzing with chatter and half-drunken theories about how he did it. Some linger near the stage, hoping for one last glimpse."
    "人群慢慢地散开，流传着关于他如何做到的闲言乱语和半裸的理论。 有些人在舞台上逗留，希望最后一瞥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_eb8d2dfa:

    # "Soon, you find yourself almost alone in front of the now-quiet platform. The floating orbs dim. Only the crackle of dying bonfires and distant festival music remains."
    "很快，你发现自己几乎孤独地站在现在的安静的平台前。漂浮的半兽人已经暗淡。只有死亡的营火和遥远的节日音乐的裂缝还剩下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_3f91d6b9:

    # "The short rabbit magician is nowhere in sight... but you can still smell the remnant of his salacious scent, lingering in the air."
    "短兔子魔术师是看不到的…… 但你仍然可以闻到他残留的恶臭， 留在空气中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_973a2437:

    # "You wonder if he's already preparing for the next show he teased about."
    "你想知道他是否已经在准备 下一场他嘲笑的节目了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_20c5237e:

    # "The rabbit magician is collecting some of his props from the ground, as you approach him."
    "兔子魔术师正在从地面收集他的道具 当你接近他的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_39d8fed9:

    # rb "Oh-ho! What's this I spy with my twitchy little eye? It's a stranger who wanders in the yonder."
    rb "哦，我用我那小眼神偷窥什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_6fbcf740:

    # rb "You, yes, you. Are you lost? No matter, come hop closer and help me grab that thing."
    rb "你，你，你迷路了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_cd738eff:

    # "The rabbit gestures to a small pouch lying on the tall shelf. It was right on the edge, but the short rabbit couldn't seem to reach it."
    "兔子的手势是放在高架子上的小袋子 它就在边缘 但短兔子似乎无法到达。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_b6c417c5:

    # e "Yeah, sure. Need a lift?"
    e "是的，当然。需要搭便车吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_809b0e5d:

    # "He crosses his arms, looking up at you with a frown."
    "他双臂交叉，用皱眉向上望着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_a4eea615:

    # rb "I'm not stooping that low to get a lift, tallie! Just a hand."
    rb "我可不是这么低调 搭便车的，高个子！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_843fc205:

    # e "Yeah, sure."
    e "是的，当然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_6c789994:

    # "You step forward, and reach for the pouch. It was surprisingly easy."
    "你站出来，拿袋子来，这太容易了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_5979e435:

    # "It was a small leather bag, with a fake pocket inside that seems to be bottomless. You scratch your head as you hand it to the rabbit below."
    "那是个小皮袋，里面还有一个仿佛无底的假夹层。你挠挠头，把它递给下面的兔子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_cb693b07:

    # rb "Boof! Saw my little secret there, didn't you."
    rb "看到了我的小秘密，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_4f801fd9:

    # "The rabbit snatches the pouch from you slickly."
    "兔子从你身上偷取了邮袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_ba74e647:

    # rb "A magician never reveals his tricks, but since you happen to catch it in a happy little happenstance, we'll call it even then."
    rb "魔术师从来不会暴露他的把戏 但是既然你碰巧在快乐的小意外中抓住它 我们甚至会叫它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_dad4370c:

    # e "What's even?"
    e "什么是平衡？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_2353447a:

    # rb "Why, you help me out, and in return, you've seen my little trick."
    rb "你帮我，作为回报，你已经看到了我的小把戏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_aa4fb683:

    # e "Little trick for a little guy, what does that make me? Two gold?"
    e "给一个小男孩的小把戏，那我是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_d09e0f29:

    # rb "Hey! Stop with your stupid short jokes."
    rb "嘿，别开玩笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_e9541d5a:

    # e "S-sorry! I'm just kidding alright."
    e "对不起，我只是在开玩笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_3c180394:

    # e "Sorry, I'm in a hurry."
    e "对不起，我赶时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_9e4b6357:

    # rb "Wait no, hey! Don't be a rude little rutabaga now, wouldn't ask ya if I've got arms longer than my legs."
    rb "等等，别这么粗鲁，我胳膊比腿长也不会问你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_86d46942:

    # e "Nah..."
    e "Nah……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_efa5534a:

    # "You watch as the rabbit sighs as he hops a few times more, just barely reaching the pouch."
    "你看着兔子的叹息 看着他跳了几倍多 几乎达不到邮袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_e319198e:

    # rb "Not in a hurry to watch me stumble, huh? Fine, fine. You teensy little tease."
    rb "好吧，好吧，你这小小闹事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_a4e96f39:

    # "The rabbit grumbles, before he climbs on his own wand and leaps up high enough to grab it. He lands back on the ground with a thud."
    "兔子在爬上自己的魔杖 跳到足以抓住它之前 就会发牢骚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_7fe2afd3:

    # rb "How's that? Still got it, don't I?"
    rb "怎么样 还行吧 不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_1cfa71ca:

    # "You clap lightly."
    "你轻轻拍拍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_edd21d1f:

    # e "That's impressive for your-"
    e "这是令人印象深刻的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_ee8946d7:

    # rb "Hey, don't call me short! I know you're thinking that!"
    rb "嘿，别叫我矮子 我知道你在想这个！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_b02faba4:

    # e "No, I wasn't."
    e "不，我没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_49a1eff3:

    # "The rabbit huffs, crossing his arms."
    "兔子毛巾 穿过他的手臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_05cdec6f:

    # rb "Sure you weren't. I know what you're thinking."
    rb "当然没有 我知道你在想什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_4e676040:

    # e "I wasn't. Swear."
    e "我没有。发誓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_e2f9f24b:

    # "He stares at you with squinting eyes, until a grin spreads across his face again."
    "他瞪着眼睛盯着你，直到他脸上再露出笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_138db419:

    # rb "Anyway, I'm Ribba, the greatest magician in all of the land!"
    rb "总之，我是里巴， 世上最伟大的魔术师！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_6e257199:

    # "Ribba spreads out his arms. A wide grin on his hooded face."
    "里巴伸展了他的手臂 面罩上长着笑容的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_a382c1bc:

    # rb "And you are..."
    rb "而你是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_d81dea2f:

    # e "I'm-"
    e "I'm-"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_f48f9495:

    # rb "No, no. Don't tell me. I knew I knew. Yes- oh yes. You are..."
    rb "不，不。别告诉我。我知道、我知道。没错——哦，没错。你是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_9e1a786c:

    # rb "You are [e], right? And a busty courier from the lusty Lusterfield, a must-see, I must say."
    rb "你是[e]，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_728a1d02:

    # "The rabbit winks at you, and you feel your cheeks flush."
    "兔子向你眨眼，你的脸脸都冲了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_711a45c9:

    # e "H-how do you know that?"
    e "你怎么知道的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_1c07027c:

    # rb "A magician's secret. Don't fuss about it."
    rb "魔术师的秘密，别大惊小怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_e7a93ae3:

    # "After a pause, the rabbit feints a mischievious grin as he swirls his wand around the pouch."
    "稍稍停一下，兔子们就笑得一塌糊涂，因为他在邮袋周围挥舞着魔杖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_c85ff08c:

    # rb "Oh, never mind. Fuss about it. Cause I've got your bad little Badge."
    rb "哦，别管了，别管它了，因为我有你那坏小徽章。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_7267d511:

    # "The rabbit suddenly pulls out a small badge, and you recognise it immediately."
    "兔子突然拿出一个小徽章 你立刻认出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_9ba13d47:

    # e "That's... mine! How did you do that?"
    e "那是我的，你是怎么做到的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_fa2fd219:

    # e "It wasn't even in my bag! Where did you get it?"
    e "包里没有，你从哪弄来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_7bfec14a:

    # rb "Like I said, magic..."
    rb "就像我说的，魔法……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_a5a27d85:

    # rb "It's a good thing you didn't help me, or else I would feel bad about it."
    rb "幸好你没有帮我 否则我会后悔的。"

